# Production IQ recordings and metadata are hosted on Cloudflare R2. The editor
# reads the Worker's live bucket index and never discovers recordings here.
# Local data copies remain ignored because a few browser tests use them; the
# historical tracked metadata sidecars are no longer deployment inputs.
/example_recordings/**/*.sigmf-data
